Lemma xstep2_none_ok : forall segs nx0 BR F M0, XSTEP2_ok segs nx0 BR xstep2_none F M0.
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S80!1,5|600;!1+40|30;%~R1!1+X!1+4!1,52!2'cE!1,5|21;1!2+^J+W+W!1+X5!1'e:#G$segs;R!1+T+o<$nx0;R+1$BR;R!1+T+7$F;R!1+T'p0$M0;R3vd$_H;R!3+L+O!3'R'p0!1'p;#4#2,^9$_H0;R!3+L+O!2'p<#4#5,^9$fx;R+e5$id;R+1$ss;R+W$ssa;R+W$ssb;R+W$E;R+0$R;R4$Mc;R3$H;R!3+L6!3'p=#<#7#6!2,Z5!4,`4+W+W#5#4$_H1;R!9+p>#@#?#>#=#<#4#7#3#2&H0;R!6'^06!3'p=#>#9#8$e;R6-XRN$o;R!1+X5w#12$~R5+^2+^3,^4!2,Z5!4,`4+W+W#7#6#2+^2!2'^5!2+B+e5$fx';R+e5!2+B+0$E';R+0!2+B4$R';R4!2+B3$Mc';R3!2+B+W$ss';R+W!2+:!2+G!3+L+W#1#=!3+L+W#1#<!2+:!3'bZ!1'^G#>#;#4!2+:!9+p>#G#F#E#D#C#4#1#3#2!3+e8#G!5'e9#@#:!2'_@0!1'^D#>#97!5'e9#5#3!2'_@0!1'^D#1#27#1!6'p?#5#4#3'p=#2#1").
Qed.
Lemma xstep_none_ok : forall segs nx0 BR F M0, XSTEP_ok segs nx0 BR xstep_none F M0.
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S70!1,5|600;!1+40|30;%~R1!1+X!1+4!1,52!2'cE!1,5|21;1!1+X+W!1'e:#E$segs;R!1+T+o<$nx0;R+1$BR;R!1+T+7$F;R!1+T'p0$M0;R3vd$_H;R!3+L+O!3'R'p0!1'p;#4#2,^9$_H0;R!3+L+O!2'p<#4#5,^9$fx;R+e5$id;R+1$ss;R+W$ss';R+W$E;R+0$R;R4$Mc;R3$H;R!3+L5!3'p@#;#6#5!2,Z+W#4&H0;R!6'^05!3'p@#<#7#6$e;R5-XRN$o;R!1+X+Ww#12$~R+W+^2+^3,^4!2,Z+W#5#1+^2!2'^5%~R!9+p>#@#?#>#=#<#5#7#4#3!2+B+e5$fx';R+e5!2+B+0$E';R+0!2+B4$R';R4!2+B3$Mc';R3!2+:!3'bZ!1'^G#<#:#3!2+:!9+p>#E#D#C#B#A#3#;#2#1!3+e8#E!5'e9#>#9!2'_@0!1'^D#<#86!5'e9#4#2!2'_@0!1'^D#;#16#1!6'pA#5#4#3'p@#2#1").
Qed.
End SGP.
